OL,3,GNEWSA'Clear human rights failures' in
OL,4,Asouthern Scotland, report finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new report has found "clear human
OL,7,Frights failures" across the south of
OL,8,FScotland with basic obligations on
OL,9,Ffood, health and housing not being met.
OL,11,FThe study was carried out over eight
OL,12,Fdifferent local authority areas which
OL,13,Fare home to more than a million people.
OL,15,FThe Scottish Human Rights Commission
OL,16,F(SHRC) concluded that the biggest
OL,17,Fchallenge was accessibility as, even if
OL,18,Fservices did exist, they were often
OL,19,Funreachable in practice.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
