OL,3,GNEWSA'Clear human rights failures' in
OL,4,Asouthern Scotland, report finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FDeputy First Minister Jenny Gilruth
OL,7,Fsaid the Scottish government already
OL,8,Foffered free transport for a range of
OL,9,Fgroups, while public service reform
OL,10,Frepresented an opportunity to "push
OL,11,Fpower out" to communities around the
OL,12,Fcountry.
